#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Code execution {#code-execution}"
msgstr "Esecuzione del codice {#code-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Click **Run** on any code block. The first click starts a Jupyter kernel via"
" [Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine). After that, runs are instant.\n"
msgstr ""
"Clicca **Run** su qualsiasi blocco di codice. Il primo click avvia un kernel"
" Jupyter tramite [Binder](https://mybinder.org) o [IBM Code "
"Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine). Successivamente, le esecuzioni sono "
"istantanee.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Simulator Mode (no account needed)** — Enable [Simulator Mode](/jupyter-"
"settings#execution-mode) to run all notebooks with AerSimulator or noise-"
"model FakeBackends. Zero setup required.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Modalità Simulatore (nessun account necessario)** — Attiva la [Modalità "
"Simulatore](/jupyter-settings#execution-mode) per eseguire tutti i notebook "
"con AerSimulator o FakeBackends con modelli di rumore. Nessuna "
"configurazione richiesta.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Quantum Hardware** — Enter your API token and CRN in "
"[Settings](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) once — credentials are auto-"
"injected on every run. [Create a free "
"account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) if you don't have "
"one.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Hardware IBM Quantum** — Inserisci il tuo token API e CRN nelle "
"[Impostazioni](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) una volta — le credenziali "
"vengono iniettate automaticamente ad ogni esecuzione. [Crea un account "
"gratuito](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) se non ne hai uno.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Available execution backends</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Backend di esecuzione disponibili</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Every tutorial has executable code blocks. Click **Run** to execute them "
"using one of four backends:\n"
msgstr ""
"Ogni tutorial ha blocchi di codice eseguibili. Clicca **Run** per eseguirli "
"usando uno dei quattro backend:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Binder** (default on GitHub Pages) — Free remote Jupyter kernel via "
"[mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Binder** (predefinito su GitHub Pages) — Kernel Jupyter remoto gratuito "
"tramite [mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Code Engine** — Serverless Jupyter on your IBM Cloud account. Cold "
"start in seconds instead of minutes. [Set up](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine)\n"
msgstr ""
"**IBM Code Engine** — Jupyter serverless sul tuo account IBM Cloud. Avvio a "
"freddo in pochi secondi anziché minuti. [Configura](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Local Jupyter (Docker / RasQberry)** — Connects to the local Jupyter "
"server with Qiskit pre-installed\n"
msgstr ""
"**Jupyter locale (Docker / RasQberry)** — Si connette al server Jupyter "
"locale con Qiskit preinstallato\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Custom server** — Point to any Jupyter endpoint in [Settings](/jupyter-"
"settings#advanced-settings)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Server personalizzato** — Punta a qualsiasi endpoint Jupyter nelle "
"[Impostazioni](/jupyter-settings#advanced-settings)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When multiple backends are available, choose which one to use from "
"[Settings](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"
msgstr ""
"Quando più backend sono disponibili, scegli quale usare dalle "
"[Impostazioni](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</details>\n"
msgstr "</details>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Deployment options</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Opzioni di distribuzione</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "doQumentation is available as:\n"
msgstr "doQumentation è disponibile come:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Static site with "
"[Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine) for remote code execution\n"
msgstr ""
"**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Sito statico con "
"[Binder](https://mybinder.org) o [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine) per l'esecuzione remota del codice\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)**"
" — Full stack locally, offline capable\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)**"
" — Stack completo localmente, utilizzabile offline\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Self-hosted on Raspberry Pi with "
"local Jupyter kernel\n"
msgstr ""
"**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Self-hosted su Raspberry Pi con "
"kernel Jupyter locale\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Run locally with Podman / Docker</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Esegui localmente con Podman / Docker</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) or [Docker "
"Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / "
"Linux), then run:\n"
msgstr ""
"Installa [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) o [Docker "
"Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / "
"Linux), poi esegui:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Open [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) — code execution works "
"locally, no Binder wait time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Apri [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) — l'esecuzione del "
"codice funziona localmente, senza tempi di attesa per Binder.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For a lightweight version without local code execution (~60 MB):\n"
msgstr "Per una versione leggera senza esecuzione locale del codice (~60 MB):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Using Docker instead? Just replace `podman` with `docker` — the commands are"
" identical. Images are multi-arch (`linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`), so Apple "
"Silicon Macs work natively.\n"
msgstr ""
"Usi Docker invece? Sostituisci semplicemente `podman` con `docker` — i "
"comandi sono identici. Le immagini sono multi-arch (`linux/amd64` + "
"`linux/arm64`), quindi i Mac Apple Silicon funzionano nativamente.\n"
